    ["59:547c"] = "MOM: Right. \
All boys leave \11home some day. \11It said so on TV. \12Prof. Oak, next door, is looking \11for you.",
    ["59:54e3"] = "There's a movie on TV. Four boys \11are walking on \11railroad tracks. \12I better go too",
